{"unit_id":"SQHLnb666__mindsea#card-zh","repo":"SQHLnb666/mindsea","commit":"169a30394c52bf379979db111c255e45f9643cc3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**识海 MindSea**（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DSH 提供保存在本机 SQLite 中的长期记忆，自动整理会话内容，并支持按词、日期和情绪检索。它注册 memory_search、memory_event、memory_write 三个工具，在每轮结束后把顶层会话的新增消息交给 DSH 的语言模型判断并写入记忆库；新会话首次组装提示词时还会附上最近十句原话。侧边栏面板可浏览记忆、事件、版本、阶段、决定、日期和自动化状态，也能修改记忆分类。适合希望跨会话回看内容、管理长期记忆的 DSH 用户。需要本地 SQLite 库和宿主提供的模型；默认数据库为 sea2.db。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:447-458","index.js:460-543","index.js:603-629","index.js:684-745","index.js:756-790","lib/query.mjs:31-48","lib/routes.mjs:75-101"]}
{"unit_id":"SQHLnb666__mindsea#card-en","repo":"SQHLnb666/mindsea","commit":"169a30394c52bf379979db111c255e45f9643cc3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"MindSea is a DSH web plugin for local SQLite memory. It classifies new top-level messages with the host model. Tools search memories, expand event histories, and write records; a browser panel displays, filters, and corrects them. New sessions can include the ten latest messages.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:447-458","index.js:460-543","index.js:603-629","index.js:684-745","index.js:756-790","lib/query.mjs:31-48","lib/routes.mjs:75-101"]}
